 "description": "$0.01 per call. Use when you need who holds ONE pump.fun token right now, from our per-wallet ledger of its curve trades: up to 100 holders largest first (wallet, share of supply, first-buy slot and time, buys, sells, labels), the concentration block (top-5 and top-10 share, HHI) and a cohorts block grouping supply by launch role (dev, bundlers, snipers within 2 s of the create slot) with share, wallets and SOL in and out, plus the holders' reputation across tokens (share held by known dumpers, repeat bundlers and wallets new to our tape, since 2026-09-27T00:18:34Z). Labels are observations, not a verdict on a wallet. Input: mint (a mint or a pump.fun/gmgn/solscan/birdeye link), limit. Needs full live coverage and feed lag <= 5 s (uncovered, stale or a curve not quoted in SOL: refused before payment, nothing charged). The ledger stops at migration. Trade by trade: mint_flow.",
